do GameManager.lock_player()
Boss: HA! HA! HA!
Boss: Now, who do we have here? Quite the small specimen.
Boss: You must be the one disturbing my nest. You're a lot tougher than you look.
Boss: Unfortunately, I cannot allow for you to continue. The era of the RAT is about to dawn.. and I will not let a SOUL infringe on the endowment hour.
Boss: Hey! Take this as a complement. It shall be an honor to see me in combat. Perfection incarnate.
Boss: Now please enjoy...
Boss: A SLOW. PAINFUL. DEMISE! HA! HA! HA!
ShopMan: What in tarnations? I don't know what is going on here, but never in history have mutant rats displayed Sapience. This is ominous, Rookie. Something at large is at play.. something beyond our comprehension.
ShopMan: Be careful, this is not going to be a cake walk.
